MainPart v1.32 beta
Is now able to read FAME 2.0 data file 
headers if you use FAME.library 6.0
developer version without using FAME2.0. 
Also a small fix has been done with the 
FAMEDoorConfig Doors where the display 
always created an wrongly error message.

MainPart executable is not included in this archive, because it has to be
individual registered. So get it from your next reg site or ask via
e-mail for it.

